{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60879736230fa35de91843963271d0bcf70ee8ea23e128bb5c472532756514fe", "ja": "（風花が今度出演するドラマ、魔法学園の\n新しい衣装が届いた。ゴシックで雰囲気があるな）", "zh": "（风花下次要出演的电视剧《魔法学园》的新服装送到了。哥特风，很有氛围感啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a5c69b0c2a72b8980bdc1db5e7d0da5172145ddf651ecd571d1930b8eb67c3eb", "ja": "わぁ……♪\nクールで神秘的で、本当に素敵な衣装ですね♪", "zh": "哇……♪\n又帅气又神秘，真的很棒的服装呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f7a9b70708a696e4a880b72eea0103687fe1870972a3f8ef5c2820183268e56c", "ja": "ちょっと、胸元は空いてますけど……\nきっと胸より、この印のほうが気になりますよね♪", "zh": "虽然胸口露得有点多……不过，比起胸部，您肯定更在意这个印记吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1003_p", "source_sha256": "399fc0275632b51233853871740bacb40d6d696df8150847b5f96b935b89041f", "ja": "（そうかな……）", "zh": "（是这样吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aa63a62f60c534b48477a188d088432333d1039f31f4b10bd1f35c156d8ba9f6", "ja": "？　あの、{$P$}さん？\nどうかしましたか？", "zh": "咦？那个，{$P$}先生？您怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bda3535db16bbe55d1f439f2bf77aa3801736a73b130de9fa69c51aa1b60bf26", "ja": "え？　ああ、何でもない。\nカッコイイ衣装で、風花に似合ってると思う！", "zh": "诶？啊，没什么。\n我觉得这身帅气的服装很适合风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "390044c373471862ecf89987341f5a9679020a0cda7235ecc855ea8ae86a29d3", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　この胸元の印、架空の\n文字らしいんですけど、何か意味があるんでしょうか？", "zh": "谢谢您♪　胸口这个印记，好像是虚构的\n文字，会有什么含义在里面吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1007_p", "source_sha256": "828fe9b6c35957a786d8780e647486c2292ea2fd2b7410303147825f7b73b482", "ja": "そういえば、設定とかあるのかな。\n今度、聞いておこうか。", "zh": "说起来，不知道有没有什么设定呢。\n下次找机会问问吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "247067939c3837d182eb3f9e70fbf97b8e654e45455ccc32be339dabbd0d9d73", "ja": "はい！　素敵な衣装に、不思議な印……\nなんだか、本当に魔法が使えちゃいそうですね♪", "zh": "是呀！漂亮的服装，还有神秘的印记……\n总觉得真的能用出魔法来了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d090d5911ec2a3fda21bde5594c5240f833fdbbc7feaf77aed21dc73d04a3748", "ja": "魔法が使えたら便利だろうな。\nたとえば、風花はどんな魔法を使いたい？", "zh": "要是会用魔法的话，应该会很方便吧。比如说，风花想用什么样的魔法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1e61704e630cd4098f67c0588cf5903948b790f96fa0641e552f8c4e90d22097", "ja": "私は……そうですね。やっぱり、どんな形でも\n人を癒すことのできる魔法に憧れます。", "zh": "我……这个嘛，果然还是憧憬着那种无论以何种形式，都能治愈他人的魔法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "da64ae30b847dd8a92e152e838d37e766108cfde47bbb0fd10711b4535c4a5b5", "ja": "傷を治したり、疲れた心を包み込んだり……。\n辛そうにしている人がいたら、力になれますから。", "zh": "治愈伤口，包容疲惫的心灵……要是有人看起来很痛苦，就能帮助他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dba92e0401d198371f76d900b55e15e2e8e7a3ceac6f584c1fc205a9ab147932", "ja": "そうか。風花らしい答えで安心したよ。", "zh": "这样啊。是很符合风花风格的回答，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5477c53d3b0347ac02a20b2129d0e36ce500b05e173685f2953ccf88497ebdce", "ja": "ふふっ。代わり映えしないかもしれませんけど……\nやっぱり、誰かを支えられたらって考えてしまって。", "zh": "呵呵。也许听起来没什么新意……\n但我还是会想着，要是能支持谁就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1014_p", "source_sha256": "70ac2602d9951a5372d2f4f48e9012e9baf20b539d2ebcf3ef7d5210098b6cf1", "ja": "いや、立派だと思う。けど、魔法に\n頼らなくても、もう実現できてると思うけどな。", "zh": "不，我觉得这已经很了不起了。不过，就算不依靠魔法，我觉得你也已经实现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1015_p", "source_sha256": "25e16c51d2fd6e92e6b9e72570d1db93b623ad1a75ef0112131c9c458c940138", "ja": "風花は看護師の頃も、アイドルの今も、誰かの\n心の支えになってる。魔法使いみたいなものだよ。", "zh": "风花无论当护士时，还是现在当偶像，都在支撑着某个人的心。简直就像魔法师一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4e4a0537b8bb7e5708493c7f7e28e8d3a3a9e93f117b3ccd2d3538a118c265b8", "ja": "{$P$}さん……ふふ。\nありがとうございます。そうだといいな……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……呵呵。\n谢谢您。要是能那样就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bb6e65769f1a1161aab4c745e8ac63fa3c039aae9f04015894b8c65cd424934d", "ja": "でも{$P$}さんだって、\n私にとっては魔法使いみたいなものですよ？", "zh": "不过，{$P$}先生对我来说，也像是魔法师一样哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "94e8ca0d0d5ceae263b6f0eb53c2936bff5be9db131013733e367a2d13cf02db", "ja": "私が今ステージに立てているのは、ファンのみんなや、\n{$P$}さんのお陰なんですから。", "zh": "我能站在现在这个舞台上，都是托粉丝们和{$P$}先生的福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0494_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4582d61d9c50e5a2127acd719872d44ea99e74b759776abf3ba6bd7037096b1", "ja": "私……これからもたくさんの人たちに\n喜んでもらえるように、お仕事、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "我……今后也会努力工作，\n让更多的人感到开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
